Refactored StreamedKeyList components to use shared utilities

• Created `src/app/key/lib.ts` with shared utilities:
  - `KeyPair` interface for type consistency
  - `colorMap` constant for score-based color mapping
  - `getColorForScore()` function to determine color tier
  - `formatClipboardText()` function for consistent clipboard formatting
  - `useStreamedKeys()` hook that encapsulates all streaming logic and state management

• Updated `src/app/key/encryption/streamed-key-list.tsx`:
  - Removed duplicate streaming logic, state management, and color mapping
  - Now uses shared `useStreamedKeys` hook and `getColorForScore` function
  - Maintained encryption-specific unique key generation pattern
  - Reduced component from 158 lines to 48 lines

• Updated `src/app/key/signing/streamed-key-list.tsx`:
  - Removed duplicate streaming logic, state management, and color mapping
  - Now uses shared `useStreamedKeys` hook and `getColorForScore` function
  - Maintained signing-specific key generation pattern (simpler than encryption)
  - Reduced component from 158 lines to 46 lines

The refactoring eliminates ~200 lines of duplicate code while maintaining the same functionality and preserving the subtle differences between encryption and signing key display patterns.